# Single source of truth

Start of every turn: `AGENTS.md` → `field-guide/index.md` → `docs/architecture/STATUS.md` → latest `docs/reviews/*.md`. Handshake: `DEC-066-AGENTS`. Ranking: `DEC-066-INDEX`.

- If `STATUS.code_freeze` is true, do not write Python.
- Follow `STATUS.next_role` (`proposer` | `reviewer` | `user`). Do not ACK in the same turn as proposing.
- Rubber-stamp reviews are invalid. New `DEC-*` ids are user-only.
- Cursor `~/.cursor/plans/*.plan.md` is not canon unless it headers `canon_generation` matching STATUS. Prefer repo ADRs.
- Physics lives in `docs/decisions/DEC-*.md`. Do not paste ADR essays into this rule.
